/T (Refer to the Material Safety Data Sheet \(MSDS\) for detailed handling and safety instructions. Store the product in a cool, well-ventilated area away from ignition sources. Use protective equipment such as gloves, safety goggles, and masks during application. Avoid direct contact with eyes and skin; if contact occurs, wash immediately with soap and plenty of water. In case of inhalation, move to fresh air and seek medical attention if discomfort continues. This product contains no added Lead, Mercury, or Chromium compounds and is flammable. Dispose of leftover paint or empty containers responsibly through authorized recycling or waste management agencies. ays follow the recommended mixing ratio. Stir well and strain before use. Select the appropriate thinner and dilution percentage depending on climatic conditions. For higher temperatures, a slow-drying thinner is recommended for a better finish and leveling.)
